  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• To a large bowl, add couscous and vegetable stock.\n• Add the boiling water (3/4 cups for 2 people / 11/2 cups for 4 people) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83bce4264524ca978daba/step-2ce8eb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber and tomato.\n• In a small bowl, combine hummus and golden goddess dressing. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83bce4264524ca978daba/step-2be6be10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Add chermoula spice blend and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83bce4264524ca978daba/step-3613ce20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To bowl with couscous, add cucumber, tomato, baby spinach leaves, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Toss to combine. Season to taste.\n• Divide couscous-spinach salad between bowls.\n• Top with Moroccan plant-based chick'n.\n• Drizzle over hummus dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83bce4264524ca978daba/step-8f005730.jpg"
    }
  ]
